{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Project Chaos",
    "steam_appid": 2304790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/0f5dc70ebfd54a05cdd1596f51f07983.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>Based in claustrophobic small maps, with reactive and fast paced movement, PROJECT CHAOS boasts a lack of lengthy death timers, transporting you back into the fight instantly, keeping the momentum of the game rolling.<br><br>Deaths and kills are not recorded and displayed, in favour of a score based system, where bonuses and also detriments can increase or decrease the score. With the goal of the game to obtain the highest score as either a team or a solo player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/b04b3641974d1e37593fefd24b6d977c.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>Jump into chaotic battles with Project Chaos signature mode: Chaos. Where with each life you spawn with a completely different loadout. Use the constant changes to learn new weapons, experiment with different playstyles or just enjoy the bonkers mess the gamemode produces.<br><br>Or for the more classic players, jump into the normal Team Death Match and Free For All gamemodes, where you can use your pre-set loadout in an attempt to cause as much chaos as physically possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/f45237ada09695da50a4dc3dc87ddceb.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>You can only cause so much chaos with a stick, so Project Chaos only the provides the most powerful weapons for players to wield.<br>With options like:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smart Rocket Launchers,<br></li><li>.50 Cal Snipers, <br></li><li>Miniguns, <br></li><li>Lightning SMG\u2019s,<br></li><li>Full Auto Incendiary Shotguns,<br></li><li>and much more make up the in game arsenal.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/0f5dc70ebfd54a05cdd1596f51f07983.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>Based in claustrophobic small maps, with reactive and fast paced movement, PROJECT CHAOS boasts a lack of lengthy death timers, transporting you back into the fight instantly, keeping the momentum of the game rolling.<br><br>Deaths and kills are not recorded and displayed, in favour of a score based system, where bonuses and also detriments can increase or decrease the score. With the goal of the game to obtain the highest score as either a team or a solo player.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/b04b3641974d1e37593fefd24b6d977c.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>Jump into chaotic battles with Project Chaos signature mode: Chaos. Where with each life you spawn with a completely different loadout. Use the constant changes to learn new weapons, experiment with different playstyles or just enjoy the bonkers mess the gamemode produces.<br><br>Or for the more classic players, jump into the normal Team Death Match and Free For All gamemodes, where you can use your pre-set loadout in an attempt to cause as much chaos as physically possible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2304790/extras/f45237ada09695da50a4dc3dc87ddceb.avif?t=1692869014\" /></span><br>You can only cause so much chaos with a stick, so Project Chaos only the provides the most powerful weapons for players to wield.<br>With options like:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Smart Rocket Launchers,<br></li><li>.50 Cal Snipers, <br></li><li>Miniguns, <br></li><li>Lightning SMG\u2019s,<br></li><li>Full Auto Incendiary Shotguns,<br></li><li>and much more make up the in game arsenal.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Project Chaos Is A High Octane, Manic &amp; Chaotic, Multiplayer First Person Shooter. Set In 2098, A Team Of Rebels, Activists &amp; Terrorists Band Together With One Goal: To Incite Change. Their Method Of Choice? Chaos!",
